  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197538",
      "title": "Using & Styling Nested Text",
      "lectureOrder": 72,
      "videoOrder": 69,
      "sourceHash": "3e223791899d386546631b4ac93d25d7e65d1742222d016b5f3d6c5cf0a59433",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.345,
          "end": 6.267,
          "en": "Now to highlight X and Y we can wrap X and Y",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.34,
          "end": 12.34,
          "en": "in extra text elements, in extra text Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.57,
          "end": 14.75,
          "en": "And this is something we haven't done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.75,
          "end": 16.42,
          "en": "up to this point in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.42,
          "end": 19.04,
          "en": "but it is something that is absolutely fine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.04,
          "end": 22.23,
          "en": "and which you can do with React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.23,
          "end": 25.53,
          "en": "A text Component, actually can't hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.53,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "too many other kinds of Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 32.003,
          "en": "For example, a text Component should not really wrap a view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.05,
          "end": 37.29,
          "en": "but a text Component can contain other text Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 40.88,
          "en": "So having a text Component besides the plain text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.88,
          "end": 43.77,
          "en": "in another text Component is allowed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.77,
          "end": 47.11,
          "en": "and is absolutely something you can do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.11,
          "end": 51.02,
          "en": "And what this allows us to do is add different styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.02,
          "end": 54.76,
          "en": "to this text than to the rest of this text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.76,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "So therefore here I'll add another text wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 61.46,
          "en": "around the Y and then we can prepare some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.46,
          "end": 65.523,
          "en": "for this text in general, and then for the X and Y texts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.55,
          "end": 69.45,
          "en": "Now let's start with the text in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.45,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "For this, I'll add the summary text styling property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 77.58,
          "en": "and here I just wanna set the font family to open sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.58,
          "end": 79.75,
          "en": "That's basically all I wanna do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.75,
          "end": 84.61,
          "en": "but then I also wanna add a highlight styling object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.61,
          "end": 87.02,
          "en": "where I set the font family to open sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.02,
          "end": 89.5,
          "en": "bold so that we have some bold text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 92.78999999999999,
          "en": "and where the color is set to colors primary 500",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.382,
          "end": 96.85300000000001,
          "en": "so that we assign a color to that text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 97.89,
          "end": 100.64,
          "en": "And now we can use these styling objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.64,
          "end": 104.97999999999999,
          "en": "to style the text and the texts inside the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 104.97999999999999,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "The wrapping text receives the style prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 109.9,
          "en": "to assume the styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.9,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "Summary text, styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 114.17,
          "en": "and the inner texts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.17,
          "end": 119.17,
          "en": "that wrap X and Y receive style=styles.highlight",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 119.63,
          "end": 122.023,
          "en": "both these texts receive that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.26,
          "end": 126.23,
          "en": "And we could again create a reusable component for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.23,
          "end": 128.67,
          "en": "but here this is all the pretty reusable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.67,
          "end": 131.22,
          "en": "since we assigned the same reusable style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.22,
          "end": 133.053,
          "en": "to these two text Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.32,
          "end": 138.89,
          "en": "With that we now got this summary text below this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.89,
          "end": 142.6,
          "en": "Now, when I look at it, I'm not totally happy with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.6,
          "end": 144.38,
          "en": "To make this a bit prettier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.38,
          "end": 147.04,
          "en": "I actually wanna increase the text size.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.04,
          "end": 151.15,
          "en": "So on the summary text, I'll ramp up the font size to 24",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.32,
          "end": 153.95,
          "en": "and now this is bigger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 153.95,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "And please note that the text that's nested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 160.04,
          "en": "into another text element also is resized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.04,
          "end": 161.92000000000002,
          "en": "This is not inheritance at work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.92000000000002,
          "end": 163.35,
          "en": "but instead this is related",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.35,
          "end": 168.3,
          "en": "to how this is compiled to a Native Component internally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 170.69,
          "en": "If we have a view that contains a text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.69,
          "end": 172.825,
          "en": "and we add a font size to the view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.825,
          "end": 177.825,
          "en": "it would not affect any nested text elements in the view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.1,
          "end": 181.34,
          "en": "Nested text elements inside of other text elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.34,
          "end": 185.19,
          "en": "however, are affected by the text specific styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.19,
          "end": 188.66,
          "en": "you do set on the parent text Component though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.66,
          "end": 191.18,
          "en": "Though when we set a font size on the outer text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.18,
          "end": 194.49,
          "en": "the nested texts are also affected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.49,
          "end": 195.7,
          "en": "That in the end works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.7,
          "end": 198.75,
          "en": "as you would expect it to work, I guess",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.75,
          "end": 201.993,
          "en": "and it's definitely worth noting that it works like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.15,
          "end": 206.7,
          "en": "So now we have this styling, centering the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.7,
          "end": 208.18,
          "en": "would also be nice still.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.18,
          "end": 211.54,
          "en": "So I will also add text align center here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.54,
          "end": 213.41,
          "en": "for the summary text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.41,
          "end": 215.813,
          "en": "so that this is centered like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 217,
          "end": 219.57,
          "en": "Now last but not least below all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.57,
          "end": 221.27,
          "en": "I'd like to have a button that allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 221.27,
          "end": 223.38,
          "en": "to start a new game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.38,
          "end": 226.92000000000002,
          "en": "So below of this text, I'll add the primary button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.92000000000002,
          "end": 229.53,
          "en": "which therefore of course must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.53,
          "end": 231.973,
          "en": "from Components UI primary button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 232.95,
          "end": 237.44,
          "en": "And then on this primary button, I'll say start new game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.44,
          "end": 240.32,
          "en": "and we will later add the on press prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 240.32,
          "end": 243.743,
          "en": "to trigger some function that does start a new game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.04,
          "end": 247.39,
          "en": "When we save this, we have this button here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.39,
          "end": 249.46,
          "en": "and now maybe some spacing would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 249.46,
          "end": 251.72,
          "en": "so on that summary text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.72,
          "end": 254.45,
          "en": "we can actually add a margin vertical",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 254.45,
          "end": 257.963,
          "en": "so margin top and bottom of 24 maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 259.62,
          "end": 261.67,
          "en": "With that there is some spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.67,
          "end": 263.65,
          "en": "between the button and the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 263.65,
          "end": 266.8,
          "en": "and actually, maybe we just want margin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 266.8,
          "end": 269.20799999999997,
          "en": "to the bottom, now that I look at it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.20799999999997,
          "end": 271.423,
          "en": "yeah, I think that looks nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.82,
          "end": 277.23,
          "en": "So now we have that, we have this game over screen finished",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.23,
          "end": 280.28,
          "en": "at least regarding the styling and the layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 280.28,
          "end": 282.85,
          "en": "but what's missing is of course that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
